                <pb facs="0898" n="814" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg814"/>

                <head>No. 404.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Curry to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-10-20"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 20, 1886</date>.
                        (Received October 20—9 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Curry informs Mr. Bayard that he has been desired by the Spanish minister of
                    state to say that the statement is authorized by the Government of Spain that it
                    much desires the arrangement of the disagreement with the Government of the
                    United States.</p>
            </div>
